+| Cancel invite | Admin, owner | Deletes a pending invite of the own entity. |
+| Accept / decline invite | Invitee only (e-mail match, case-insensitive) | Shown on the entity switcher and onboarding. Accepting creates the membership with the invite role (never a duplicate), selects the entity and opens its dashboard; accepting twice is a no-op; expired invites cannot be accepted. Declining deletes the invite. |
